1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:03,200
Shh! Who can hear the jingle?

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:05,300
Jingle, jingle!

3
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:06,986
Can you guess?

4
00:00:06,986 --> 00:00:09,008
What makes a jingle sound?

5
00:00:11,508 --> 00:00:12,828
Here is a clue.

6
00:00:12,828 --> 00:00:13,927
It's little,

7
00:00:13,927 --> 00:00:15,247
round and gold.

8
00:00:15,597 --> 00:00:18,318
It sits on my pink collar!

9
00:00:20,918 --> 00:00:23,093
It's Mimi's little bell!

10
00:00:23,493 --> 00:00:25,183
My bell was snuggled

11
00:00:25,183 --> 00:00:26,432
in my blanket,

12
00:00:26,432 --> 00:00:27,387
all along!

13
00:00:27,737 --> 00:00:29,447
Ollie Owl helped me

14
00:00:29,447 --> 00:00:30,768
listen for it.

15
00:00:31,518 --> 00:00:32,518
Jingle!

16
00:00:33,018 --> 00:00:34,748
When I feel worried,

17
00:00:34,748 --> 00:00:36,779
I ask a friend for help.

18
00:00:37,129 --> 00:00:39,103
Can you jingle with me?

19
00:00:39,103 --> 00:00:40,470
Jingle, jingle!

20
00:00:42,470 --> 00:00:45,213
Thank you for helping me listen!

21
00:00:47,863 --> 00:00:49,670
Share with a friend and

22
00:00:49,670 --> 00:00:51,963
subscribe to Honey Bunny Kidz!

23
00:00:52,563 --> 00:00:54,200
Watch the full story

24
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:55,838
on Honey Bunny Kidz!
